{
    "title": "GetCode - Virtual Number SMS",
    "description": "GetCode offers a virtual number service for your business or personal needs at competitive prices. Whether you need a second WhatsApp number, or verifications for your Instagram, Telegram, Google Gmail accounts, and more, GetCode serves you at the best rates.\r\n\r\nGetCode provides completely clean and dedicated phone numbers. These numbers are guaranteed to be compatible with all popular platforms from WhatsApp to Instagram, from Telegram to Google Gmail. Hence, creating a second Telegram or WhatsApp account or adding an additional verification step to your existing accounts is now much easier and cost-effective.\r\n\r\nWith just a few clicks on GetCode, you can get a new number at competitive prices, create a new account on the platform you want, or securely verify your existing account. GetCode, providing numbers from more than 60 countries, allows you to get a US number or another number even if a local phone number is not available.\r\n\r\nGetCode operates globally and operates in over 60 countries worldwide. Some of the countries we cover include the USA, Canada, Mexico, Brazil, Argentina, UK, France, Germany, Italy, Spain, Turkey, Russia, South Korea, Australia, New Zealand, and many more. Wherever you are, GetCode is with you. Even if a local phone number is not available, we allow you to get a US number or another number. We continue our vision of globalization to make you feel at home.\r\n\r\nHow to Use:\r\n\r\nUse GetCode to get a second WhatsApp, Instagram, Telegram, or Google Gmail number.\r\nUse this number to create a new account or add an extra verification step to your existing account.\r\nPromote your number so that your customers, followers, or friends can reach you.\r\nChoose GetCode for your virtual number needs with our competitive prices and superior service quality.\r\n\r\nTrademark Notice:\r\n\r\nThis application is an independent application and has no direct relationship with WhatsApp, Instagram, Telegram, Google Gmail, or other services. The names of these services, associated trademarks, logos, and banners are the property of the relevant services. All trademarks, product names, and company names or logos mentioned herein are the property of their respective owners.",
    "descriptionHTML": "GetCode offers a virtual number service for your business or personal needs at competitive prices. Whether you need a second WhatsApp number, or verifications for your Instagram, Telegram, Google Gmail accounts, and more, GetCode serves you at the best rates.<br><br>GetCode provides completely clean and dedicated phone numbers. These numbers are guaranteed to be compatible with all popular platforms from WhatsApp to Instagram, from Telegram to Google Gmail. Hence, creating a second Telegram or WhatsApp account or adding an additional verification step to your existing accounts is now much easier and cost-effective.<br><br>With just a few clicks on GetCode, you can get a new number at competitive prices, create a new account on the platform you want, or securely verify your existing account. GetCode, providing numbers from more than 60 countries, allows you to get a US number or another number even if a local phone number is not available.<br><br>GetCode operates globally and operates in over 60 countries worldwide. Some of the countries we cover include the USA, Canada, Mexico, Brazil, Argentina, UK, France, Germany, Italy, Spain, Turkey, Russia, South Korea, Australia, New Zealand, and many more. Wherever you are, GetCode is with you. Even if a local phone number is not available, we allow you to get a US number or another number. We continue our vision of globalization to make you feel at home.<br><br>How to Use:<br><br>Use GetCode to get a second WhatsApp, Instagram, Telegram, or Google Gmail number.<br>Use this number to create a new account or add an extra verification step to your existing account.<br>Promote your number so that your customers, followers, or friends can reach you.<br>Choose GetCode for your virtual number needs with our competitive prices and superior service quality.<br><br>Trademark Notice:<br><br>This application is an independent application and has no direct relationship with WhatsApp, Instagram, Telegram, Google Gmail, or other services. The names of these services, associated trademarks, logos, and banners are the property of the relevant services. All trademarks, product names, and company names or logos mentioned herein are the property of their respective owners.",
